  "identifier": "winpipe",
  "description": "Provides support for Windows Named Pipes for inter-process communication through the 'Win32' C++ API. Allows to create, connect, disconnect, read from, and write to server and client pipes as standard R connections. Includes convenience utilities to parse and build Access Control List (ACL) security descriptors. HTTP requests are indirectly supported via background relay servers.",
